Say, just one moment.

00:18:58.560 --> 00:18:59.340
Are you feeling all right?

00:18:59.440 --> 00:18:59.960
Oh, I'm feeling...

00:19:01.200 --> 00:19:04.560
We've been travelling all day. I'm tired. I'm thirsty. My tongue's hanging out.

00:19:17.500 --> 00:19:18.400
I'm not so tired.

00:19:19.600 --> 00:19:23.340
I like the pullover. Is that the A-line?

00:19:23.520 --> 00:19:26.120
No, it's the clothesline. I made it myself.

00:19:26.360 --> 00:19:28.000
You're very clever. It's a smash, isn't it?

00:19:28.100 --> 00:19:29.860
I think it would suit you much better like that.

00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:32.860
You really do? No, I like the way it goes round and...

00:19:32.860 --> 00:19:34.300
Well, it did do. Where is it? Give it to me back.

00:19:34.580 --> 00:19:35.580
You're messing about, old man.

00:19:40.270 --> 00:19:42.250
I say, you've got one like mine, haven't you?

00:19:42.630 --> 00:19:44.250
Oh, it does suit you. Let me have a look.

00:19:44.590 --> 00:19:45.410
Oh, it's marvellous.

00:19:46.580 --> 00:19:48.040
It is mine. What are you doing with it?

00:19:48.520 --> 00:19:49.220
Give it to me back.

00:19:49.500 --> 00:19:50.800
I must stand for that, lark.

00:19:51.160 --> 00:19:53.700
Well, I could say, you can make your own.

00:19:53.800 --> 00:19:54.680
I'm not having a little business.

00:19:58.820 --> 00:19:59.500
Where are you?

00:20:00.190 --> 00:20:00.710
I'm here.

00:20:01.680 --> 00:20:02.840
Look, who do you think you are?

00:20:03.280 --> 00:20:04.960
I am a spaceman.

00:20:05.220 --> 00:20:06.000
Yes, but where are you?

00:20:06.490 --> 00:20:06.890
I'm here.

00:20:11.060 --> 00:20:11.660
Oh, look.

00:20:12.200 --> 00:20:12.800
An elephant.

00:20:17.150 --> 00:20:17.890
Give me trunks.

00:20:18.050 --> 00:20:18.970
I say, let me out of here.

00:20:19.070 --> 00:20:20.270
Well, I'll let you out if you don't stretch it.

00:20:20.390 --> 00:20:21.090
I won't stretch it.

00:20:21.330 --> 00:20:22.330
What are you messing about for?

00:20:22.390 --> 00:20:22.870
