Oh, hello.

00:20:29.330 --> 00:20:29.970
You're campotender.

00:20:30.000 --> 00:20:31.400
Please, our camp attendant.

00:20:31.800 --> 00:20:34.180
Anything you want, just you call for me.

00:20:34.360 --> 00:20:36.120
Oh, anything we want, just call for him.

00:20:36.400 --> 00:20:37.540
Who do we call for?

00:20:37.800 --> 00:20:40.000
Well, you could call me Ferdinand.

00:20:40.640 --> 00:20:41.240
I think above.

00:20:42.860 --> 00:20:43.580
What's his name?

00:20:43.700 --> 00:20:45.520
His name's Ferdinand.

00:20:45.580 --> 00:20:46.220
Don't do that.

00:20:46.360 --> 00:20:50.930
Oh, look, everybody's gone crazy.

00:20:51.050 --> 00:20:51.550
Get to bed.

00:20:51.980 --> 00:20:52.360
Oh, well.

00:21:12.090 --> 00:21:13.090
What are you looking for?

00:21:13.650 --> 00:21:14.650
Look, I want the facilities.

00:21:15.410 --> 00:21:16.550
The what?

00:21:16.770 --> 00:21:17.490
The facilities.

00:21:17.750 --> 00:21:19.790
What's the, what's that?

00:21:20.110 --> 00:21:22.230
Look, we must have the basin and the jug.

00:21:22.900 --> 00:21:24.860
Oh, the facilities?

00:21:25.320 --> 00:21:25.520
Yes.

00:21:26.250 --> 00:21:28.090
Oh, we must have the facilities, mustn't we?

00:21:28.290 --> 00:21:28.890
Of course we must.

00:21:29.470 --> 00:21:29.830
I'll call.

00:21:30.340 --> 00:21:31.520
Right, then go on, cork him.

00:21:32.050 --> 00:21:32.890
Won't be long now.

00:21:35.950 --> 00:21:36.270
Facility!

00:21:37.540 --> 00:21:38.720
Oh, he's such a nice boy.

00:21:38.800 --> 00:21:39.460
Do anything for anybody.

00:21:39.700 --> 00:21:40.220
Your thing!

00:21:40.620 --> 00:21:42.040
Oh, how can I ever thank you?

00:21:45.050 --> 00:21:46.230
And your water!

00:21:46.550 --> 00:21:47.510
Oh, what a nice boy.

00:21:47.650 --> 00:21:48.950
Thank goodness, now we can get to bed.

00:21:53.180 --> 00:21:54.480
Say, look, who do you think you are?

00:21:54.600 --> 00:21:55.680
I'm Rebecca going for the beer.

00:21:55.780 --> 00:21:57.060
Don't forget anything you are!

00:21:57.060 --> 00:21:57.080
You

00:22:18.980 --> 00:22:21.740
I mean, we're going to enjoy ourselves while we're here, haven't we?

00:22:43.410 --> 00:22:56.810
Mr. Bade!

00:23:09.980 --> 00:23:11.900
Don't you left it on? No, you put it out.

00:23:32.490 --> 00:23:43.660
Oh, be quiet, will you? Go to sleep. Stop snoring, will you?

00:23:43.840 --> 00:23:57.640
It was amazing. Absolutely terrific.

00:23:57.960 --> 00:23:58.800
Yeah, have a nap, sir.

00:24:01.000 --> 00:24:01.840
How was it, Sarah?

00:24:02.080 --> 00:24:03.720
Oh, darling, it was wonderful. It can't miss.

00:24:03.980 --> 00:24:06.900
Good. I wonder what Crawley Horses thought.

00:24:08.980 --> 00:24:09.720
Wasn't that terrific?

00:24:10.060 --> 00:24:12.620
Oh, terrific. It was wonderful, son. I can't remember what I'm laughing for.

00:24:13.380 --> 00:24:15.200
I'm still laughing. Oh, dear.

00:24:16.000 --> 00:24:17.520
It's not right for television, though.

00:24:19.480 --> 00:24:19.760
