00:24:23.130 --> 00:24:24.670
You mean to say it's too funny?

00:24:24.930 --> 00:24:25.770
Oh, it's much too funny.

00:24:26.050 --> 00:24:27.350
No, it's not exactly too funny.

00:24:27.590 --> 00:24:29.550
It's got too much movement. It's too broad.

00:24:30.000 --> 00:24:32.480
Quite, um, intimate enough, if you see what I mean.

00:24:32.580 --> 00:24:34.340
Yeah, I see what you mean. It's not quite intimate enough.

00:24:34.340 --> 00:24:36.020
Yeah, intimate enough. Dickie sees exactly what I mean.

00:24:36.340 --> 00:24:38.110
But he's got the laughs, didn't he?

00:24:38.130 --> 00:24:39.050
Oh, he's got plenty of laughs.

00:24:40.250 --> 00:24:41.290
And they went...

00:24:43.390 --> 00:24:44.750
Yes, no.

